msgstr "Optimisé"

msgid "Off (?flxp_off=1)"
msgstr "Désactivé (?flxp_off=1)"

msgid "Adding ?flxp_off=1 to a URL opens the page without optimizations; if the page looks different, the cause is here."
msgstr "Adding ?flxp_off=1 to a URL opens the page without optimizations; si la page est différente, la cause est ici."

